# NestJS add-ons

- The HTTP API is NestJS in `apps/api`. Do not add a second Node server.
- One add-on equals one module under `apps/api/src/app/addons/<name>/` with a module, controller, service, and spec.
- Current add-ons: `slack`, `teams`, `jira`, `linear`, `github`. Register every new module in `AppModule` and tag it with `@ApiTags`.
- Document every public handler with `@ApiOperation` and response DTOs that use `@ApiProperty`.
- Keep the global prefix `api`. Swagger UI stays at `/api/docs`. Regenerate the spec with `npx nx openapi api`.
